98
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:05,100
That's perfectly understandable.

99
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:11,460
Our aim is to be transparent and flexible so we can reach a mutually beneficial outcome.

100
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:14,580
