207
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:23,980
That perspective is appreciated.

208
00:14:23,980 --> 00:14:29,660
Internally, however, we still need to balance strategic value with financial discipline.

209
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:30,660
Of course.

210
00:14:30,660 --> 00:14:36,180
Perhaps we can start by reviewing the feedback you received from your internal stakeholders.

211
00:14:36,180 --> 00:14:37,180
Certainly.

212
00:14:37,180 --> 00:14:43,940
Overall, they see value in your proposal, particularly in terms of reliability and operational

213
00:14:43,940 --> 00:14:44,940
