227
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:38,140
That level of detail would be very useful.

228
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:42,500
It would allow us to plan production and logistics more efficiently.

229
00:15:42,500 --> 00:15:45,060
One concern we have is flexibility.

230
00:15:45,060 --> 00:15:49,620
If market conditions change, we may need to adjust volumes.

231
