242
00:16:27,380 --> 00:16:30,180
That level of attention would be reassuring.

243
00:16:30,180 --> 00:16:35,300
We found that investing time early prevents misunderstandings later.

244
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:38,220
That aligns with our experience as well.

245
00:16:38,220 --> 00:16:43,780
Moving on to logistics, we understand that delivery reliability is a key concern.

246
00:16:43,780 --> 00:16:48,700
Yes, late deliveries have caused significant disruption in the past.

